  "story": {
    "day": 63,
    "title": "Kaya's Bus Ride Home",
    "sentences": [
      "Today, Kaya had volleyball practice near school.",
      "She walked fast to the bus stop.",
      "When the bus came, she got on to get to her stop.",
      "A boy was also on the bus. Who was he?",
      "He looked very busy. He held a book about a leopard.",
      "Its marking was unique.",
      "Kaya thought, \"I never saw one climb so high.\"",
      "Soon, she had to get off. She had to run home.",
      "Her mom, an office worker, said, \"Welcome home.\"",
      "\"Who's hungry for any delicious soup?\" she asked.",
      "Kaya said, \"We can eat soon! We're hungry!\"",
      "First, we must wash our hands. They finished their work."
    ]
  }
}